WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.540
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:16.870
Elza.

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.490
Forgive me for the sudden summons.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:22.580
I feel like it's been a long time since we last spoke.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.750
Elza-sama! Kirara was so lonely!

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:33.340
Oh, right! There's going to be a fireworks show at Kira Kira Bay tonight, right Rei-chan?

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.640
Seeing fireworks during winter will be quite intriguing.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.170
I agree. Let's all go together.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:40.990
Yay!

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:45.650
Now then, why don't we chat over a meal until it's time to go?

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.650
Thanks, Elza.

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:52.040
Come, it's the beginning of a perfect night!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:34.140
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:36.760
How was that, Yume-chan?

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:40.530
Great! You've gotten a lot better, Aria-chan.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:44.810
I'm glad! I'm very glad!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:47.770
Now then...

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.520
A toast!

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.540
Cheers! {considered making the last line "kanpai"}

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:54.320
Elza, congratulations. You've finally received the Sun Dress.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.030
Congratulations, Elza-sama! {from these lines I'd consider altering the cheers ones to be like "to Elza!" but they're too generic}

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.390
I appreciate it.

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:05.210
It's from Aria.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:09.910
She says "It's almost time for my show with Yume-chan! I'm so excited!"

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:17.120
Yume-chan and Aria have been working really hard, squeezing in extra training between their other work.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:19.760
Don't you think they'll make a great unit?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.640
I anticipate great things.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:27.470
Tonight's appetizer is vegetable aspic.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.480
So pretty!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:40.160
There's one month left until the 
Aikatsu Ranking Final Tournament.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:45.530
It's essential to collect as many points as possible from the coming events.{no elza, games in april count just as much as games in september}

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:50.160
Because only the top four idols make it in, right?

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:54.320
I asked you here today to discuss how best to secure those spots and create—

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.380
An overall strategy, I presume.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.380
You read my mind, Rei.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:06.510
Since we arrived in Japan, the idols of 
Four Star Academy have pushed us forward.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:11.270
Yep! I even made an amazing friend in Ako-chan!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:17.750
Right when we first got here, I was super busy trying to start up FuwaFuwa Dream.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:22.610
But then I met Ako-chan, and we did those presentations together.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.590
It was so much fun!

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.450
Looking back on it now...

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:34.420
It feels like Aikatsu's become way more fun ever since I met Ako-chan!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:38.830
You certainly have grown quite a bit since we came to Japan.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:43.670
Only the two of you could have come up with such an inspired choice to be double muses.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:48.270
Really? Yay, you praised me!

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.680
Aren't me and Ako-chan the best double muses ever?

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:56.940
I'm just really happy about being able to go on stage with you!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.900
Did you forget already?

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:06.530
I've said since the very beginning that I wanted us to be muses together.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:09.670
You still haven't given that up?

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.400
Didn't I tell you?

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:23.130
And don't you still love FuwaFuwa Dream as much as I do?

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:08.300
You have a strong worldview and the power to draw your audience into it.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:13.180
Build upon that skill and you'll be able to claim your spot in the Ranking.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:20.240
Okay! I'll work hard to bring more people into the world of FuwaFuwa Dream that I love!

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:25.610
I have prepared a variety of personalized soups for you.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.320
For Rei-sama, potato Vichyssoise.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.950
For Kirara-sama, shrimp bisque.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:35.200
And for Elza-sama, I have prepared carrot potage.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.080
Goodness, vegetables again?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.330
It is vegetable habit-forming month. {I'm glad jp yahoo answers always has something for phrases like this}{I guess this a thing}

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.420
Exchange it for something else.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.420
Very well, I will at once.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.250
Rei.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:54.560
You've changed quite a bit yourself since coming to Japan.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.810
You may be right.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:01.580
When I first joined Venus Ark, I devoted myself solely to supporting you.

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.480
I thought that was all I wanted.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:06.070
But then...

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:11.910
Mahiru made me realize how wonderful it was to hone your own brilliance.

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:16.410
And for me, that means to shine for Elza alone.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:26.170
If you ask most idols why they Aikatsu, many will say that they wish to shine for themselves or their fans.{um, this was a legit screwup in the original I guess}

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:31.660
While I admit that I share some of those feelings, it is not the most important reason for me.

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:35.100
My sole purpose...

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.310
is for Elza.

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:46.650
I will be Elza's sword and shield.

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:51.690
Royal Sword is a brand made only for Elza.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:59.160
I wish to devote myself entirely to making the sun that is Elza shine ever brighter!

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:03.700
That is my will, my passion, and my dream!

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:07.170
I was finally able to commit.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:12.220
I resolved myself to walk the path of an idol as a model.

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:19.010
At the Final Tournament, I'll put on 
a performance that you can be proud of.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.730
Rei-chan, you're so cool!

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:23.730
Elza.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:25.350
I have a proposal. {her spoon is big}

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.570
It's about the direction we should take Venus Ark after this.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:34.740
What do you think about cooperating with outside idols to mutually empower—

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.000
Hey, Miranda. Are you hungry?

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:51.380
Today's steak is high quality French Boeuf de Bazas with foie gras.

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.460
It looks delicious!

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:57.520
Sorry, but would you mind making something for Miranda as well?

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:58.400
Yes.

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:00.680
Right away.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:05.330
Boo, boo, boo! You're the only one Miranda likes, Rei-chan!

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:08.190
Why doesn't she ever come to me?

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.650
She's a smart girl.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:14.880
She must still remember the prank you played on her the first time you met.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.200
Seriously?!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:20.470
Yeah. It just goes to show how precious each encounter is.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:25.710
Come to think of it, you originally came to Japan for Hime, right Elza?

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:30.180
I did. She was the idol closest to the Star Wings.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:34.130
Good day, Japan.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:40.410
A new age of Aikatsu dawns.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.570
Wait for me, idols of the world.

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:46.480
I, Elza Forte...

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:48.740
Will plunder you all!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:55.150
My first objective in coming here was indeed to get Hime Shiratori.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.830
Then I encountered Yume Nijino, the idol Hime singled out.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:06.670
It was a happy miscalculation that the students of Four Star obtained Star Wings one after the other.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:14.500
Kirara, Aria, and myself also earned our own.

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.480
Yes.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:20.850
And at last I obtained the Sun Dress.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:30.750
All I must do now is reign over the Aikatsu Ranking with this dress.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:39.530
Aria's place in the ranking might change after her concert today too.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:40.660
It may.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.780
I believe it's about time for it to begin.

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.670
Let's show them our perfectly practiced performance!

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.560
Here we go, Aria-chan.

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:55.360
Yes!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:57.550
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:01.010
May the flower of Aikatsu bloom!

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:25.030
Dresses are a charm for beauty!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.800
Dresses can make everyone shine!

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.470
That was a marvelous show.

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:55.200
The Aikatsu Ranking was updated.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.460
Wow, look at Yume-chan's rank!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.710
She's second after Elza.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:06.180
Yume Nijino, I expected you to close in on me.

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:08.970
Good. That's how it should be.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.350
We should probably make our way to the fireworks soon.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.900
Fireworks, fireworks!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.030
I'm excited, I'm very excited!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.360
You sure are full of energy even after our performance.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.450
Aikatsu is more fun the more you do!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.080
Good work, you two.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.870
We're all ready to go.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.130
Rola, Koharu-chan, thanks for coming.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.380
Mahiru-chan and Ako-chan will be here soon.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.260
Aria?

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.880
What're you doing?

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:54.390
I'm taking notes on today's Aikatsu with Yume-chan before I forget.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.720
Your notebook's filling up nicely.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:01.980
Yes! Reading through my memories later is important Aikatsu too!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.600
That's a real passion for Aikatsu!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.520
Yes!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:08.780
If you wouldn't mind, could you please tell me more about your own Aikatsu, Rola-san?

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.240
Mine?

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:13.160
Where do you derive your strength from?

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.160
If I had to say...

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:23.870
I think I turn my feelings of frustration into the power to move forward.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.500
Looks like I lost.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.460
Yeah...

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:34.760
But this isn't the end.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.300
There will be much more in the future.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:40.220
As long as I'm an idol.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.230
Yeah.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:46.020
I may have lost to Elza-san at our last competition,

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:49.400
but I'm gonna keep on shining the way only I can do!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.900
I'm going to write that down!

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.990
You're tenacious and competitive.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.530
And that's what makes you cool!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.540
Tenacious...

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:06.170
Hey, wait! It's embarrassing to hear you say that out loud!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.960
Rola's so cute.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.260
We've arrived.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.050
Sorry we ran late.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.300
It's fine, don't worry about it.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.220
Everyone's here now.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:20.100
How about we head on out to Kira Kira Bay then?

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.770
{kind of hesitating on putting anything here, want input}

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:32.110
<i>She who controls the dresses controls Aikatsu. {Elza's line from 51}</i>

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:38.490
<i>This is the answer I arrived at after traveling around the world.</i>

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.710
I'm so excited for the fireworks.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.830
It's not as cold as I expected.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.370
I can hardly wait!

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.620
I agree, Ako-chan.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.040
What's up?

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.050
Geez!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.930
I can't take any more!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.350
Mahiru-chan?

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:09.940
Come on, Mahiru...

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.570
Sorry, I just couldn't take it.

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:17.280
Honestly, just how much of a perfectionist can you be?

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:20.820
But that personality of hers is a big benefit to her Aikatsu.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.200
She's just like a hero of justice.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.910
I'd like to hear more about Mahiru-san as well!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:32.210
Mahiru-chan is meticulous and faces everything with stoicism.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.460
That's just how I've always been since I was a child.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:41.010
You are right though that it has helped me out in more than just modeling.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:46.930
It's also probably why you got so upset with Rei-san that one time.

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.440
Upset with her?

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:53.440
I mean, I just wanted her to value herself more.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.360
That's such a waste!

00:18:56.610 --> 00:19:00.780
There's no reason to sacrifice yourself for someone else's shine.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:05.910
Faced with the stunning light of a bright star, what you should do is shine even brighter!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:12.880
Mahiru was still a new model when she enrolled.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:17.380
At the time, I may have been her first star.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:23.300
But from there, she scraped her way up in an effort to surpass me.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.980
And ultimately, she managed to do it at the S4 Selection.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.480
Mahiru surpassed you?

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:37.070
Yes. I was overjoyed to see her growth.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:44.870
It was because she was there, always chasing after my back, that I was able to do my best.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:49.290
Nothing compares to having a rival.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:56.630
Huh, I never knew you talked to Mahiru-chan's sister about that.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.880
So yummy!

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:07.760
Yozora and Mahiru polish each other and push one another to greater heights.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:12.020
I have lots of fun doing Aikatsu with the Four Star girls too!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:16.190
Yes, it's beneficial to have someone you can work with.

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:21.030
But I prefer snatching victory with my hands alone.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.910
Pardon me for interrupting.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:26.830
Elza-sama, guests have arrived.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:31.910
Yume, Aria, your performance was fantastic.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.670
Thank you.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.420
Oh, and sorry to drop in on you like this.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:40.670
I just got the idea that seeing the fireworks together would be more fun.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.680
We were just talking about the same thing.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.800
Ako-chan, let's watch together!

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:57.940
I've never seen such pretty fireworks before!

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.990
Isn't it beautiful the way they glimmer?

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.080
Yes, it is.

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:17.460
The Sun Dress you wore during your last show was incredible.

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:24.590
I will end up atop the Aikatsu Ranking in my Sun Dress.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:29.800
To think this all began with my plan to acquire Hime Shiratori.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:34.480
And now we're ending up competing directly.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:40.980
I was blown away when I first saw your Star Wings.

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:47.240
I wondered how I could make a dress of my own that could bring joy to those who see it.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:52.120
My answer was to create Rainbow Berry Parfait with Koharu-chan.

00:21:55.210 --> 00:22:03.300
Elza-san, I believe that idols can make others shine given a stage, a dress, and a smile.

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:10.010
Yume Nijino, show me how you shine at the Final Tournament!

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:15.180
I will! This time, I'll be the one to surprise you!

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:22.940
I want to become a first-star idol who can shine together with everyone.

00:23:55.830 --> 00:24:00.460
Everyone's emotional Aikatsu is shiny and full of dreams!

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:06.090
That's right! I met everyone, 
made S4, and did lots of Aikatsu too.

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:09.510
I'll aim to be the world's first star through my Aikatsu!

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:12.970
No! Venus Ark is being dissolved?!

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.600
I'm sure Elza must have a good reason.

00:24:15.600 --> 00:24:18.520
We have to relight Elza-sama's spark!

00:24:18.520 --> 00:24:20.520
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:22.020
Venus Crisis!

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.310
Become the first-star idol!
